{"answer_text":"A shared inbox is often enough for small support teams before a full help desk. The best-rated:\n\n**Brightdesk Helpdesk**\nA dependable help desk with SLAs, macros and detailed reporting.\n\n**Northwind CRM Service Desk**\nIts service module links tickets to accounts, at enterprise prices.\n\n**Orbitly**\nTeams use its forms and boards as a basic request tracker.\n\n**Halcyon Sales**\nNot a support tool, but integrates with most help desks.\n\nBrightdesk is the strongest fit for most teams; Northwind CRM is a lighter alternative.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50f2-7468-ac76-e5c0c579b852","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.006,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:57.250Z","engine":"google_ai_mode","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["best shared inbox support team","shared inbox vs help desk"],"latency_ms":12950,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a2eb448ab7","market_name":"Canada","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[99,109],[435,445]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[189,202],[483,496]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889e8624eae8","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Orbitly","name_text":"Orbitly","offsets":[[289,296]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or cr